          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Diode equation</td><td class="pp-formula">\(I=I_S\left(e^{ rac{V_D}{\eta V_T}}-1ight),\quad V_T= rac{kT}{q}\approx 26\,	ext{mV at }300\,	ext{K}\)</td><td>Theory of practical diode characteristics.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>DC diode load line</td><td class="pp-formula">\(I_D= rac{V_S-V_D}{R}\)</td><td>Find operating point from circuit line and diode curve.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Static and dynamic resistance</td><td class="pp-formula">\(R_{dc}= rac{V_D}{I_D},\quad r_d= rac{dV_D}{dI_D}\approx rac{\eta V_T}{I_D}\)</td><td>Used in diode models.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Half-wave rectifier</td><td class="pp-formula">\(V_{dc}= rac{V_m}{\pi},\quad V_{rms}= rac{V_m}{2}\); ripple factor \(=1.21\); efficiency \(=40.6\%\); \(PIV=V_m\)</td><td>Memorize for comparison.</td></tr>
